# Copy to .env (git ignores it) and fill in. run_agent_office.sh reads it when it starts; what's already
# set in your shell wins.

# Codemagic (🏗️ the build tower): an API token, from Codemagic → Team settings → Integrations →
# Codemagic API (or your user settings). A floor then picks its app in ⚙️ Settings → Workers → 🏗️ Codemagic.
CODEMAGIC_TOKEN=
